# Code conventions (Jeny Fit)

Binding: doc [`10-tech-stack.md`](../../docs/product/10-tech-stack.md) and [`08-frontend-architecture.md`](../../docs/product/08-frontend-architecture.md).

## Languages

- **Code:** filenames, symbols, comments, tests → **English**.
- **UI:** user-visible strings → **Spanish (es-CO)**.

```tsx
// ❌ UI label in English
<button>Save</button>

// ✅
<button>Guardar</button>
```

## Imports & paths

- Prefer alias `@/*` when configured in `tsconfig` (**TS-023**).

## React / Next

- **Server Components by default**; `'use client'` only at interactive boundaries.
- Prefer **Server Actions** for mutations unless doc 08/09 decides otherwise.

## Style tooling

- Run **`pnpm lint`** and **`pnpm exec prettier --check <touched>`** before finishing a PR (**TS-010**, once Prettier is in the repo).
- See always-apply rule `ci-quality-gate.mdc`.
